; A1200, normal build, 640x256 PAL hires without interlace: half the pixels to
; draw and no flicker, but pixels are twice as tall and some tall windows do
; not fit on screen. AGA, Paula and the static title menu as OpenRCT2-A1200-Offline.
; Without this launcher, Options > Display > Fullscreen lists 640x512 and
; 640x256 and switches between them in game.
.key RCT2DIR
.def RCT2DIR "RCT2:"
Failat 21
SetEnv OPENRCT2_AGA_LINES 256
Execute OpenRCT2-A1200-Offline "<RCT2DIR>"
UnsetEnv OPENRCT2_AGA_LINES
